# The Dockerfile copies ./build/ wholesale into the nginx document root, but
# build/ is also the CMake build tree: without this, the image picks up ~460 MB
# of object files and any test media left in there. Keep only what nginx is
# meant to serve - the solvers and accessors at the root, plus the webpack
# output in dist/.
build/CMakeFiles/
build/CMakeCache.txt
build/Makefile
build/cmake_install.cmake
build/filters/
build/solver/
build/solver_minimal/
# local test corpora, not part of the player
build/wc/
build/rg/
